title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
view-if: erc_shuffle_leadership_timer <= 0 and player_party = "erc" and difficulty > 0
on-arrival: erc_shuffle_leadership_timer += 4; month_actions += 1 if difficulty > 0
frequency: 100
card-image: img/erc/congres.png
tags: erc_party jxsi_party jxcat_party
role: card-party

= Shuffle Leadership

Changing the leadership of the party might be necessary to adapt to the changing circumstances. Factions within the party may have strong opinions regarding the selected advisors, though.

{!<div data-widget="tension-rows" data-props='{"deriveFrom":"factions"}'></div>!}

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @root: Don't change the party leadership
- @easy_discard

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors instead
tags: erc_social_left, erc_republican_core, erc_institutional_pragmatics, erc_civic_nationalists
frequency: 1

- #erc_rm_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors instead

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors
go-to: root
tags: erc_rm_advisor

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
unavailable-subtitle: We already have the maximum of [+ max_advisors +] advisors.
choose-if: n_advisors < max_advisors
go-to: erc_advisor_menu

@erc_advisor_menu
title: Add advisors from other factions
tags: erc_social_left, erc_republican_core, erc_institutional_pragmatics, erc_civic_nationalists
frequency: 1

- @erc_social_left: Add from the Left
- @erc_republican_core: Add from the Republican Core
- @erc_institutional_pragmatics: Add from the Pragmatics
- @erc_civic_nationalists: Add from Civil Society Organizations
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors

@erc_social_left
subtitle: The leftmost factions of the party want a hard stance against austerity and believe in the republican-independence movement as an engine for social transformation.
view-if: n_advisors < max_advisors

- #erc_social_left

@erc_republican_core
subtitle: The very essence of the party, the republican core are the glue that holds everything together.
view-if: n_advisors < max_advisors

- #erc_republican_core

@erc_institutional_pragmatics
subtitle: Some party members believe that the priority must be to gain institutional power to further the Left-Republican cause, even if it means making compromises.
view-if: n_advisors < max_advisors

- #erc_institutional_pragmatics

@erc_civic_nationalists
subtitle: The party has a sizable amount of sympathizers coming from the civil society, who believe wholeheartedly in the cause of independence.
view-if: n_advisors < max_advisors

- #erc_civic_nationalists

########################################## adding advisors

# erc_social_left

@add_dolors_bassa
title: ​Dolors Bassa i Coll
choice-image: img/erc/bassa.jpg
order: -10
subtitle: Secretary General of the UGT in Girona, has a strong link with many progressive social movements. {!<br><br>!}Actions:{!<br>!}Build support through unions and social movements{!<br>!}Defend the social commitments of the current government
choose-if: dolors_bassa_advisor = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Already an advisor {!<br><br>!}Actions:{!<br>!}Build support through unions and social movements{!<br>!}Defend the social commitments of the current government
view-if: n_advisors < max_advisors and dolors_bassa_advisor_available = 1
on-arrival: {!
    Q.dolors_bassa_advisor = 1;
    Q.n_advisors += 1;
    Q.erc_left_dissent = Math.max(0, Q.erc_left_dissent - 4);
!}
tags: erc_advisor, erc_social_left
go-to: erc_advisor_menu

Dolors Bassa has been added as an advisor.

