#################################### removing advisors

@remove_dolors_bassa
title: Remove ​Dolors Bassa
choice-image: img/erc/bassa.jpg
order: -10
subtitle: Actions:{!<br>!}Build support through unions and social movements{!<br>!}Defend the social commitments of the current government
view-if: dolors_bassa_advisor = 1
on-arrival: dolors_bassa_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1; erc_left_dissent += 7;
tags: erc_rm_advisor
go-to: rm_main

Dolors Bassa is no longer an advisor. The party's Left will not be pleased.

